			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;">
			<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">the overall strength and stability of general economic conditions and of the esports industry in the United States and globally;</p>
			</td>
