			<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9679;</p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:middle;width:46.7%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">our <a href="http://www.sec.gov/ix?doc=/Archives/edgar/data/1621672/000143774923023756/slgg20230630_10q.htm" style="-sec-extract:exhibit;"><u>Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q</u></a>&nbsp;for the quarter ended June 30, 2023, filed on August 14, 2023;</p>
