			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;width:46.7%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">our <a href="http://www.sec.gov/ix?doc=/Archives/edgar/data/1621672/000185173423000015/slgg20230117b_8k.htm" style="-sec-extract:exhibit;"><u>Current Report on Form 8-K</u></a>&nbsp;filed on January 20, 2023;</p>
